  "body": "For example \r\nvar promise = createImageBitmap(new Blob());\r\npromise is first pending, and later UA rejects it asynchronously.\r\nI assume the idea is that HostPromiseRejectionTracker gets called, but what is the running script in that case? The algorithm relies on running script to be there.\r\nOr, if HostPromiseRejectionTracker isn't supposed to be called, perhaps clarify that somewhere\r\n(and ensure there are tests).\r\n\r\n@EdgarChen @annevk @domenic ",
